OL,3,GNEWSAStop-and-search orders after boy,
OL,4,A13, stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have introduced temporary
OL,7,Fstop-and-search powers in a town centre
OL,8,Fafter a 13-year-old boy was stabbed.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police said the
OL,11,Fpowers also followed reports of youths
OL,12,Fcarrying weapons and wider disorder in
OL,13,FRochdale.
OL,15,FThe boy remained in hospital receiving
OL,16,Ftreatment after suffering serious
OL,17,Finjuries, while two teenage boys were
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of assault and
OL,19,Fpossession of a bladed article.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
